\par\par \b \uc2 BUZZ-COMMENT-USD/JPY choppy but in core 145-150 range for now\b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2022\par 04:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Nov 7 (Reuters) - USD/JPY has experienced some volatility since the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in earnest to slow or even halt further yen weakness on Oct 21. Yet the pair has mostly held between 145-150, which looks to remain the core range with many expecting fresh Japanese action on rallies towards 150.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been confirmed at 6.35 trillion yen in October and 2.8 trillion in September. Some players in Tokyo suggest there may have been more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  into November, notably on Nov 1-2 after USD/JPY rebounded towards 149.00,.\par \par \uc2 Although there will not be any confirmation until December when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  releases fresh data, Japanese officials have made it clear they would like to see JPY weakness contained at present,, .\par \par \uc2 Even \uc2 BOJ\uc2  Governor \uc2 Haruhiko Kuroda\uc2  chimed in, threatening possible future tweaks to yield curve control, a major factor behind JPY weakness as interest rate differentials with other major economies widen significantly. A move may even be possible before Kuroda's term ends in April 2023.\par \par \uc2 The latest IMM CFTC data suggest speculators have digested these developments. JPY shorts dropped dramatically in the week ended Nov 1 ,,, and could fall further given the current stalemate between Japanese officials and the market.\par \par \uc2 The wild card is where U.S. yields go next. With the debate over a Federal Reserve pivot persisting, rises in longer-term Treasury yields could be capped ahead of their late October highs. Related comments ,.\par \par \uc2 For more click on\par \par \uc2 (Haruya Ida is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own. Editing by Sonali Desai)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-11-10T03:41:12.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221107eib700ho5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
