with the greenback thrashing major counterparts like the yen and pound in the process, while wreaking havoc all over the world. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Ukraine Strikes Occupied Kherson as More Civilians Flee \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Ukrainian artillery struck the ferry crossing in the southern city of Kherson, the only regional capital captured by Moscow since the February invasion, as Russian forces pounded the cities of Zaporizhzhia and Kharkiv. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Investors Jump Into Turbocharged ETFs \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Despite a market rout, risky leveraged and inverse exchange-traded funds have raked in nearly $25 billion this year as investors seek to turbocharge their bets. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Chinese Traders Told Not to Disrupt Market Around Party Meeting \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Brokers and fund managers received unofficial guidance about trading activity, to reduce market volatility. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Europe's Energy Shock Spurs Rethink of Liberalized Gas Markets \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Rocked by its biggest energy shock since the 1970s, Europe is unpicking parts of a two-decade endeavor to foster a competitive market in natural gas. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Southern California's Notorious Container Ship Backup Ends \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The backup of container ships off Southern California's coast that was at the heart of U.S. supply chain congestion during the Covid-19 pandemic has effectively disappeared. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par EU Leaders Push Forward Plans to Tackle Gas Prices \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The summit discussed an emergency gas-price cap, with debate over how to support consumers without upending markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 October 23, 2022 21:00 ET (01:00 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020221024eiao00039\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pic