\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar edges up amid suspected \uc2 BOJ \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 ; pound eyes UK politics\b0\par\par\uc2 542 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 2022\par 17:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Moves dateline to New York from London; adds details on new British Conservative leader; U.S. data; analyst comments; updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By John McCrank and Amanda Cooper\par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, Oct 24 (Reuters) - The dollar was slightly higher on Monday following another suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while sterling dithered after Britain's Conservative Party settled on its third leader this year and China's offshore yuan fell to a record low.\par \par \uc2 The yen hit a low of 149.70 per dollar overnight before being swept to a high of 145.28 within minutes in a move that suggested the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  (\uc2 BOJ\uc2 ), acting for \uc2 Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , had stepped in again.\par \par \uc2 The yen was last at 148.825, down 0.71% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Yen overnight volatility surged to its highest since Sept. 21, the day before the \uc2 BOJ\uc2  stepped in to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time since 1998.\par \par \uc2 Japan likely spent a record 5.4 trillion to 5.5 trillion yen ($36.16 billion to $36.83 billion) in its yen-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Friday, according to estimates by Tokyo money market brokerage firms.\par \par \uc2 Sterling see-sawed after former Chancellor \uc2 Rishi Sunak\uc2  emerged as the next leader of Britain's Conservatives, clearing the way for him to become the country's next prime minister.\par \par \uc2 "However Sunak's premiership unfolds, there are likely to be more difficult times ahead for the UK economy as it grapples its way out of a worsening downturn and even the prospect of a general election," said \uc2 Giles Coghlan\uc2 , chief market analyst at HYCM.\par \par \uc2 "That said, there is one aspect of help for the GBP that is often overlooked. On the other side of the Atlantic, a slowdown in Federal Reserve policy would likely help lift the GBP as much, if even not more, than UK fiscal policy."\par \par \uc2 Sterling was last up 0.01% at $1.13105, off an overnight high above $1.14.\par \par \uc2 The dollar held firm after the suspected \uc2 BOJ\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but weakened, briefly turning negative, after data showed U.S. business activity contracted for a fourth straight month in October, the latest evidence of an economy softening in the face of high inflation and rising interest rates.\par \par \uc2 In September, the Fed delivered its third straight 75-basis-point rate hike, and a fourth hike of that size is expected at next week's policy-setting meeting, though how aggressive policymakers remain after that is up for debate.\par \par \uc2 At 10:40 a.m. EDT (1440 GMT), the dollar was up 0.72% at 111.91 against a basket of six peer \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The euro was last up 0.18% at $0.988, while China's offshore yuan plummeted to a new record low against the dollar of 7.3322.\par \par \uc2 Chinese President \uc2 Xi Jinping\uc2  secured a precedent-breaking third leadership term, picking a top governing body stacked with loyalists. Xi is likely to stick to his zero-COVID policy and could favor the state over private-sector growth, analysts say.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by John McCrank in New York and Amanda Cooper in London;; Editing by Bernadette Baum, Kirsten Donovan and Paul Simao) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-10-24T16:24:20.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221024eiao02v8p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
