\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Global  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : Dollar Falls against rivals on Fed and suspected  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 375 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The dollar weakened against rivals on Friday. Traders monitored news about a possible slowdown in the pace of monetary tightening by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) in December, as well as indicators from the European economy. By the end of the trading session the yen, which has been trading at the lowest levels in three decades, turned to positive as the Japanese government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  supported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 By late afternoon in New York the dollar was down at 147.45 yen, the euro was up at $0.9864, and the pound advanced to $1.1302. The DXY registered a fall of 0.77%, at 112.012 points, with a drop of 1.15% in the week.\par \par \uc2 The American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost steam after the Wall Street Journal reported that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed) may reduce the range of basic interest rate hikes at its December meeting, with an increase of less than 75 basis points. Bets monitored by the \uc2 CME Group\uc2  also show a higher probability for such a move and speeches by Chicago and San Francisco district presidents \uc2 Charles Evans\uc2  and \uc2 Mary Daly\uc2  were also on the radar.\par \par \uc2 Near the end of trading, the Nikkei Asia reported, according to sources, that the government and the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BoJ) had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  during early Saturday morning local time.\par \par \uc2 Oanda analyst \uc2 Edward Moya\uc2  said that the move happened "in perfect timing", following the devaluation of the dollar that had already been caused by the news about the Fed.\par \par \uc2 Even with no official comments from authorities so far, earlier in the day, Japan's Finance Minister \uc2 Shunichi Suzuki\uc2  had reiterated his concern with the devaluation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and reinforced his readiness for a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As for Europe, it was confirmed that the leader of the House of Commons, \uc2 Penny Mordaunt\uc2 , will participate in the election race for the post of Prime Minister, while former Prime Minister \uc2 Boris Johnson\uc2  is seeking support. Among indicators, British retail sales fell more than forecast last month, while the euro zone's consumer confidence index rose, surprising analysts.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020221022eial000gy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
