\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 7-Japanese yen jumps as traders suspect  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 716 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2022\par 22:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds quote)\par \par \uc2 By Leika Kihara, Saqib Iqbal Ahmed and Gertrude Chavez-Dreyfuss\par \par \uc2 TOKYO/LONDON/NEW YORK, Oct 21 (Reuters) - Japanese authorities likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in markets to stem the slide of the country\u8217\'20\'19s battered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, market participants said, following an unexpected jump in the yen against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The yen rose as high as 144.50 per dollar on Friday, up more than 7 yen from a 32-year low of 151.94 yen per dollar, touched earlier in the session. The dollar was last down 1.8% at 147.34 yen.\par \par \uc2 "It's very clearly the \b \highlight22\uc2 ministry of finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepping in to sell dollar-yen," said \uc2 Mazen Issa\uc2 , senior \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 Karl Schamotta\uc2 , chief market strategist at Corpay in Toronto, concurred. "We are hearing large blocks are being traded," he said. "That typically means either larger institutions are moving money or that a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in size. The clearest evidence is just the scale of dollar selling that is happening."\par \par \uc2 The Nikkei, citing a source, also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy yen and sell dollars.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 If confirmed, this would be the second time since September that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to shore up the yen.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , down about 22% against the dollar this year, has been battered as the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  sticks to an ultra-loose monetary policy, while the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and other major central banks aggressively raise interest rates.\par \par \uc2 The falling yen is pushing up import costs and households' living expenses, piling pressure on Prime Minister \uc2 Fumio Kishida\uc2  to stop the relentless fall.\par \par \uc2 WARNING SPECULATORS\par \par \uc2 While \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  Governor \uc2 Haruhiko Kuroda\uc2  has repeatedly ruled out changing the policy stance, policymakers have been vocal with their concerns.\par \par \uc2 In a speech on Friday, Kuroda stressed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve to keep rates low. "Uncertainty over Japan's economic outlook is extremely high," Kuroda said. "We must closely watch the impact financial and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market moves could have on Japan's economy and price."\par \par \uc2 Japanese Finance Minister \uc2 Shunichi Suzuki\uc2  said earlier on Friday that the authorities were dealing with \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators "strictly".\par \par \uc2 "We cannot tolerate excessive moves by speculators. We will respond appropriately while watching \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market movements with a high sense of urgency," Suzuki said.\par \par \uc2 TD\u8217\'20\'19s Issa said the market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  happened at "a very illiquid time", when traders in London were headed home for the weekend.\par \par \uc2 "It seems like it is designed to inflict as much pain as possible on, they like to use the term, speculators," Issa said.\par \par \uc2 RARE MOVES\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has rarely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. Before the September \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the last time it stepped in to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was during the Asian financial crisis of 1997 to 1998.\par \par \uc2 It spent up to a record 2.8 trillion yen ($19.7 billion) - equivalent to half its annual defence spending - in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month.\par \par \uc2 Speculation that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would step into the market again had grown over the past week as yen weakened beyond a key psychological level of 150 per dollar on Thursday for the first time since August 1990.\par \par \uc2 While authorities have denied having a line-in-the-sand in mind, political factors mean they do need to be mindful of defending psychologically important thresholds.\par \par \uc2 They also look at technical charts for key support levels for the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  which, if broken, could accelerate its decline.\par \par \uc2 Some market participants have pointed to the dollar/yen's July 1990 high above 152 as the next threshold, then 155.\par \par \uc2 Axel Merk\uc2 , president of \uc2 Merk Investments\uc2  and portfolio manager of the \uc2 Merk Hard \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund\uc2 , said he believes there is little to stop the yen from weakening again, for now.\par \par \uc2 "Ultimately these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  don\u8217\'20\'19t help that much if the underlying policy is fostering the weak yen," he said.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Tetsushi Kajimoto and Leika Kihara in TOKYO, John McCrank, Saqib Iqbal Ahmed, Gertrude Chavez and Ira Iosebashvili in NEW YORK and Dhara Ranasinghe in LONDON; Additional reporting by Kantaro Komiya and Sakura Murakami Editing by Chang-Ran Kim, Shri Navaratnam, Kirsten Donovan, Diane Craft and Daniel Wallis) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-10-21T21:02:18.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221021eial007sl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
